# Everything a build or a run writes stays out of git: the engine build, the tool builds, every log and temp file.
.out/
# Per-suite build output (dotnet build -o out) and intermediates; c-shrine-core's out/save-fixture is under out/ too.
obj/
out/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
# The repository's .gitignore ignores every bin/ folder (build output); verify/bin holds the runner scripts.
!/bin/
